<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Nebula</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f172a;
      --card: #111827;
      --primary: #38bdf8;
      --secondary: #22c55e;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --radius: 16px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #1e293b, var(--bg));
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      padding: 96px 20px 120px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
      color: #020617;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(56,189,248,.35);
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 20px;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .card {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #020617, var(--card));
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
    }

    .card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent, rgba(56,189,248,.15), transparent);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity .3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    }

    .card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .code {
      background: #020617;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: Consolas, monospace;
      color: #a5f3fc;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: #020617;
    }

    footer a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Nebula</h1>
  
  
  <p style="margin-top:40px;">
    Nebula 是一个<strong>面向 Web 服务的脚本语言与运行时系统</strong>，
    用于将词库逻辑直接映射为 HTTP 服务，显著降低后端业务编写与维护成本。
  </p>
  <div style="margin-top:32px; display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/cjxpj/nebula" target="_blank">访问 GitHub</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://gitee.com/cjxpj/nebula" target="_blank">访问 Gitee</a>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="features">
  <h2 style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:48px;">为何选择 NebulaLanguage</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>原生面向 Web 服务</h3>
      <p>
        NebulaLanguage 以内置 HTTP 服务为核心设计目标，
        通过词库与脚本即可定义接口逻辑、返回结构与执行流程，
        无需传统 Controller / Router 模板代码。
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>词库即服务</h3>
      <p>
        每一个 Nebula 词库都是可执行单元，
        可被直接映射为 Web API、WebSocket 或自动任务，
        非常适合快速构建业务中台与自动化服务。
      </p>
    </div><div class="card">
      <h3>零部署 · 直接启动</h3>
      <p>
        Nebula 内置完整运行环境，无需额外编译、复杂配置或容器部署。
        启动程序即可自动加载词库并开放 Web 服务，
        实现真正的开箱即用与即写即跑。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>





<footer>
  <p>面向 Web 服务的脚本语言</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
